    <string name="apk_help_body">Android phones cannot compile APKs, so this app does not pretend to. To ship a project as its own app:\n\n1. Long-press the project → Export as ZIP.\n2. Unzip it into app/src/main/assets/www/ of the MultiSessionBrowser repository (index.html must be directly inside www/).\n3. Optionally change applicationId, versionName and app_name in the repo.\n4. Push to GitHub → the “Build APK” action produces the APK.\n\nWhen assets/www/index.html exists, the app opens it as the home page of every new tab.</string>
    <string name="apk_help_title">How to turn a project into an APK</string>
